# TUP — copy to .env and fill in. The real .env is gitignored; never commit it.
# One OpenRouter key covers all five providers (OpenAI · Google · Anthropic · Meta · xAI).
#
# The client reads OPENROUTER_TUP_API_KEY (canonical), falling back to the generic
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY, so a standard OpenRouter setup also works unchanged.

OPENROUTER_TUP_API_KEY=
# OPENROUTER_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1   # default; override only if needed
